OL,5,G2350 John Lennon: Gimme Some Truth
OL,6,     FIn 1971, John Lennon and Yoko Ono
OL,7,     Frecorded the classic album Imagine
OL,8,     Fat their estate in Ascot. The
OL,9,     Fprocess was filmed, and gives a
OL,10,     Funique insight into the life of a
OL,11,     Flegend.
OL,12,G0115 John Lennon: Classic Albums
OL,13,     FA fascinating look at the making
OL,14,     Fof John Lennon's debut solo album,
OL,15,     FPlastic Ono Band, which saw the
OL,16,     Fformer Beatle dealing with issues
OL,17,     Fsuch as abandonment, class, love
OL,18,     Fand God.
